{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-91901c40d3cc43aa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view with diff mode in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 0\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 6\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view with diff mode in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers a run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users can\n34\tselect two or more training or pipeline runs and view their parameters and\n35\tmetrics side by side, including a diff presentation that highlights which\n36\tparameters and metrics changed between two selected runs. This replaces the\n37\tcurrent workflow in which comparison happens in exported spreadsheets because\n38\tparameters and metrics are only visible on per-run pages.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-select of two or more runs from the runs list in the Dashboard.\n43\t- A comparison view presenting the selected runs' parameters and metrics side\n44\t  by side.\n45\t- A diff mode over the same comparison surface that highlights which parameters\n46\t  and metrics differ between two selected runs.\n47\t- Comparison works within a single project only (cross-cluster and\n48\t  cross-project comparison are out of scope per the strategy).\n49\t- Validation that the comparison view works for Data Science Pipelines runs as\n50\t  well as training runs, using the run metadata already surfaced to the\n51\t  Dashboard (Data Science Pipelines is a passive component in this strategy —\n52\t  no pipeline-side code changes).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Given a runs list in the Dashboard, when the user selects two or more runs,\n57\t  then a comparison view opens showing each selected run's parameters and\n58\t  metrics side by side.\n59\t- Given two runs selected for comparison, when the user activates the diff\n60\t  view, then the parameters and metrics that changed between the two runs are\n61\t  highlighted, and unchanged values remain visible for context.\n62\t- Given runs of both kinds (training runs and Data Science Pipelines runs) in\n63\t  the same project, when they are selected together, then their parameters and\n64\t  metrics are displayed in the comparison view.\n65\t- Given runs from different projects, when the user attempts a comparison,\n66\t  then the selection is limited to a single project (no cross-project\n67\t  comparison).\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: Users can select two or more runs and view their parameters\n72\t  and metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n73\t- **HLR-3 (P1)**: Run \"diff\" view highlighting which parameters and metrics\n74\t  changed between two selected runs — a presentation mode of the same\n75\t  comparison surface as HLR-1, consolidated into this epic rather than split\n76\t  out (same component and team; splitting would build the same surface twice).\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-95b37aa021b0162c","agent_id":"a25834c90a3a0ec43","session_id":"247f599f-8d1b-4cae-a1c4-a0bcc18e8506","uuid":"194a27b7-d729-4bf4-a900-5617ae1f1314","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:14:51.878Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-91901c40d3cc43aa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 d