{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a912092c51a04ded","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open run comparison from the Model Registry view\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 0\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 6\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open run comparison from the Model Registry view\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic delivers the Model Registry entry point for run comparison: from a\n36\tregistered model version in the Dashboard's registry view, users can open the\n37\trun comparison capability populated with the run that produced that version,\n38\twithout navigating back to the runs list. The Dashboard owns the registry UI,\n39\tso this epic is owned by the Dashboard team and builds on two prerequisites:\n40\tthe run comparison view (its navigation target) and the run linkage recorded on\n41\tregistered model versions (its data source).\n42\t\n43\t## Scope\n44\t\n45\t- An action on a registered model version in the Dashboard's Model Registry\n46\t  view that opens the run comparison view populated with the producing run.\n47\t- Graceful handling of model versions that carry no run reference (legacy\n48\t  versions registered before linkage existed).\n49\t- Single-project scope: the opened comparison stays within the model version's\n50\t  project.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptanc